{"about_the_game":"<strong>Mech combat at a grand scale</strong>: From small skirmishes to epic battles with hundreds of units.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/MantisCombat.gif?t=1739569795\" /><br><br><strong>Drop into combat</strong>. Either alone, leading your squad, or commanding an army.<strong> Combined arms combat</strong> pits you against a large array of opposing units, where you can pilot any units under your command. Customize the weapon and equipment loadout for your Mech, Tank, VTOL, and Battle Armour to best suit the mission at hand. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/exploding_taurus.gif?t=1739569795\" /><br><br>Wade through battle wreaking devastation with a large variety of powerful weapons systems. Take part in the evolving battlefield, with <strong>fully destructible debris</strong> and unit wreckage.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/BaseExplosion.gif?t=1739569795\" /><br>The procedural campaign provides replayability as you wage war across the star cluster. Face logistic and tactical decisions throughout the campaign as you vie for control of strategic resources, pivotal star systems, and political objectives. Completed or failed mission objectives will have <strong>serious consequences</strong> as they impact future missions and campaign operations.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/dropship_landing.gif?t=1739569795\" /><br><br>Outside the campaign, play in <strong>Hot Drop</strong> missions: Generate a one-time procedural mission, or a fully customizable drop scenario.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/destruction_small.gif?t=1739569795\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1944880?t=1739569795","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739569795","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739569795","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739569795","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<strong>Mech combat at a grand scale</strong>: From small skirmishes to epic battles with hundreds of units.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/MantisCombat.gif?t=1739569795\" /><br><br><strong>Drop into combat</strong>. Either alone, leading your squad, or commanding an army.<strong> Combined arms combat</strong> pits you against a large array of opposing units, where you can pilot any units under your command. Customize the weapon and equipment loadout for your Mech, Tank, VTOL, and Battle Armour to best suit the mission at hand. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/exploding_taurus.gif?t=1739569795\" /><br><br>Wade through battle wreaking devastation with a large variety of powerful weapons systems. Take part in the evolving battlefield, with <strong>fully destructible debris</strong> and unit wreckage.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/BaseExplosion.gif?t=1739569795\" /><br>The procedural campaign provides replayability as you wage war across the star cluster. Face logistic and tactical decisions throughout the campaign as you vie for control of strategic resources, pivotal star s